{
 "version": 1,
 "style": "B1",
 "width": 1280,
 "height": 720,
 "fps": 30,
 "voice": {
  "path": "narration.wav",
  "lead": 0.15,
  "tail": 5
 },
 "captions": [
  {
   "start": 0.15,
   "end": 1.59,
   "text": "You wake up at seven in the morning"
  },
  {
   "start": 1.59,
   "end": 3.47,
   "text": "and pour yourself a glass of water."
  },
  {
   "start": 3.99,
   "end": 5.35,
   "text": "Your roommate walks into the kitchen,"
  },
  {
   "start": 5.67,
   "end": 6.17,
   "text": "rubs his eyes,"
  },
  {
   "start": 6.17,
   "end": 6.71,
   "text": "and smiles."
  },
  {
   "start": 7.57,
   "end": 7.79,
   "text": "Morning."
  },
  {
   "start": 7.79,
   "end": 9.19,
   "text": "Did you sleep well,"
  },
  {
   "start": 9.19,
   "end": 9.57,
   "text": "he asks."
  },
  {
   "start": 10.41,
   "end": 12.05,
   "text": "Yeah, slept like a rock,"
  },
  {
   "start": 12.05,
   "end": 12.57,
   "text": "you reply."
  },
  {
   "start": 13.29,
   "end": 14.59,
   "text": "And right above your lips,"
  },
  {
   "start": 14.79,
   "end": 16.93,
   "text": "a bright crimson box flashes:"
  },
  {
   "start": 17.79,
   "end": 18.23,
   "text": "Lie."
  },
  {
   "start": 20.13,
   "end": 21.51,
   "text": "Rated eighty-four percent."
  },
  {
   "start": 21.51,
   "end": 22.59,
   "text": "You freeze."
  },
  {
   "start": 23.15,
   "end": 24.01,
   "text": "Your roommate looks at the"
  },
  {
   "start": 24.01,
   "end": 25.13,
   "text": "breakfast you made and says,"
  },
  {
   "start": 25.77,
   "end": 28.71,
   "text": "thanks, this tastes amazing."
  },
  {
   "start": 28.71,
   "end": 30.83,
   "text": "Floating right above his mouth in bold red letters:"
  },
  {
   "start": 31.35,
   "end": 31.83,
   "text": "Lie."
  },
  {
   "start": 32.65,
   "end": 34.01,
   "text": "He thinks it is cold and bland."
  },
  {
   "start": 35.09,
   "end": 36.19,
   "text": "For the next seven days,"
  },
  {
   "start": 36.77,
   "end": 38.73,
   "text": "every spoken word in your world comes"
  },
  {
   "start": 38.73,
   "end": 40.29,
   "text": "with a verified truth rating."
  },
  {
   "start": 41.03,
   "end": 42.65,
   "text": "Green for absolute truth."
  },
  {
   "start": 43.33,
   "end": 44.89,
   "text": "Bright crimson for deception."
  },
  {
   "start": 45.87,
   "end": 46.95,
   "text": "You think this power will give"
  },
  {
   "start": 46.95,
   "end": 48.05,
   "text": "you the ultimate advantage."
  },
  {
   "start": 48.61,
   "end": 50.83,
   "text": "You think you will finally know who to trust."
  },
  {
   "start": 51.63,
   "end": 53.27,
   "text": "Instead, by day seven,"
  },
  {
   "start": 53.27,
   "end": 55.31,
   "text": "you will understand the terrifying truth:"
  },
  {
   "start": 56.01,
   "end": 58.65,
   "text": "Honesty does not save relationships."
  },
  {
   "start": 59.23,
   "end": 60.17,
   "text": "Kindness does."
  },
  {
   "start": 60.99,
   "end": 63.09,
   "text": "And polite lies are the only reason"
  },
  {
   "start": 63.09,
   "end": 64.93,
   "text": "society has not burned to the ground."
  },
  {
   "start": 65.73,
   "end": 67.41,
   "text": "By noon on day one,"
  },
  {
   "start": 67.73,
   "end": 69.87,
   "text": "you are sitting in a team meeting at work."
  },
  {
   "start": 70.21,
   "end": 72.69,
   "text": "Your manager clicks to the next slide and says,"
  },
  {
   "start": 72.69,
   "end": 74.95,
   "text": "I really appreciate everyone's"
  },
  {
   "start": 74.95,
   "end": 76.59,
   "text": "extra hours on this launch."
  },
  {
   "start": 77.19,
   "end": 78.51,
   "text": "Crimson tag: Lie."
  },
  {
   "start": 79.07,
   "end": 80.93,
   "text": "He only cares about his quarterly bonus."
  },
  {
   "start": 81.75,
   "end": 83.25,
   "text": "A colleague leans over and whispers,"
  },
  {
   "start": 83.75,
   "end": 85.91,
   "text": "don't worry, your presentation was fantastic."
  },
  {
   "start": 86.63,
   "end": 88.21,
   "text": "Crimson tag: Lie."
  },
  {
   "start": 88.77,
   "end": 90.69,
   "text": "She did not listen to a single word."
  },
  {
   "start": 91.67,
   "end": 93.99,
   "text": "Psychologist Robert Feldman discovered that"
  },
  {
   "start": 93.99,
   "end": 96.17,
   "text": "in an ordinary ten-minute conversation,"
  },
  {
   "start": 96.65,
   "end": 99.01,
   "text": "the average human tells two to three lies."
  },
  {
   "start": 99.51,
   "end": 101.43,
   "text": "We do not do it because we are monsters."
  },
  {
   "start": 102.07,
   "end": 104.01,
   "text": "We do it because radical honesty"
  },
  {
   "start": 104.01,
   "end": 105.71,
   "text": "is psychological warfare."
  },
  {
   "start": 106.69,
   "end": 108.11,
   "text": "Imagine if everyone said,"
  },
  {
   "start": 108.59,
   "end": 109.77,
   "text": "I am bored of talking to you."
  },
  {
   "start": 110.11,
   "end": 111.53,
   "text": "Your new haircut looks terrible."
  },
  {
   "start": 112.05,
   "end": 114.35,
   "text": "I only invited you because I felt obligated."
  },
  {
   "start": 115.43,
   "end": 118.11,
   "text": "Civilization survives on tiny white lies"
  },
  {
   "start": 118.21,
   "end": 120.39,
   "text": "like an engine survives on motor oil."
  },
  {
   "start": 120.39,
   "end": 121.73,
   "text": "Without that oil,"
  },
  {
   "start": 122.19,
   "end": 123.99,
   "text": "human conversation grinds together"
  },
  {
   "start": 123.99,
   "end": 125.27,
   "text": "until the gears shatter."
  },
  {
   "start": 125.99,
   "end": 127.43,
   "text": "By the end of your second day,"
  },
  {
   "start": 127.45,
   "end": 128.87,
   "text": "you are terrified to speak."
  },
  {
   "start": 129.17,
   "end": 131.37,
   "text": "Because every time someone is nice to you,"
  },
  {
   "start": 131.53,
   "end": 133.35,
   "text": "the glowing red badge tells you:"
  },
  {
   "start": 133.35,
   "end": 135.81,
   "text": "They are only trying to survive the interaction."
  },
  {
   "start": 136.47,
   "end": 137.73,
   "text": "By day four,"
  },
  {
   "start": 138.03,
   "end": 141.11,
   "text": "the small white lies stop bothering you."
  },
  {
   "start": 141.63,
   "end": 144.83,
   "text": "It is the deeper lies that begin to tear you apart."
  },
  {
   "start": 145.93,
   "end": 147.93,
   "text": "You meet your closest friend for coffee."
  },
  {
   "start": 148.57,
   "end": 151.17,
   "text": "You ask him how he has been doing since his breakup."
  },
  {
   "start": 152.09,
   "end": 153.29,
   "text": "He smiles and says,"
  },
  {
   "start": 153.87,
   "end": 156.25,
   "text": "honestly, I am completely over it."
  },
  {
   "start": 156.61,
   "end": 158.19,
   "text": "I feel freer than ever."
  },
  {
   "start": 159.13,
   "end": 160.01,
   "text": "Above his chest,"
  },
  {
   "start": 160.01,
   "end": 162.29,
   "text": "a soft red glow pulses:"
  },
  {
   "start": 162.29,
   "end": 163.39,
   "text": "Lie."
  },
  {
   "start": 164.35,
   "end": 166.15,
   "text": "He cries himself to sleep every night."
  },
  {
   "start": 167.17,
   "end": 169.37,
   "text": "Here, the crimson tag is not malice."
  },
  {
   "start": 169.85,
   "end": 170.53,
   "text": "It is shame."
  },
  {
   "start": 171.57,
   "end": 174.17,
   "text": "Humans lie to hide their bleeding wounds."
  },
  {
   "start": 174.79,
   "end": 176.51,
   "text": "We lie so our friends will not"
  },
  {
   "start": 176.51,
   "end": 178.33,
   "text": "see how fragile we really are."
  },
  {
   "start": 179.17,
   "end": 180.55,
   "text": "Then comes the real shock."
  },
  {
   "start": 181.33,
   "end": 182.15,
   "text": "You ask him,"
  },
  {
   "start": 182.55,
   "end": 183.39,
   "text": "are we good?"
  },
  {
   "start": 184.15,
   "end": 185.53,
   "text": "You felt distant lately."
  },
  {
   "start": 186.45,
   "end": 188.17,
   "text": "He pauses, looks at the table,"
  },
  {
   "start": 188.17,
   "end": 191.53,
   "text": "and says: I was envious of your promotion."
  },
  {
   "start": 192.25,
   "end": 194.75,
   "text": "And I hated myself for feeling that way."
  },
  {
   "start": 195.61,
   "end": 196.37,
   "text": "Above his words,"
  },
  {
   "start": 196.85,
   "end": 197.99,
   "text": "there is no red tag."
  },
  {
   "start": 198.71,
   "end": 201.31,
   "text": "A soft emerald light illuminates the air:"
  },
  {
   "start": 203.27,
   "end": 203.91,
   "text": "Truth."
  },
  {
   "start": 203.91,
   "end": 205.15,
   "text": "One hundred percent."
  },
  {
   "start": 205.15,
   "end": 207.21,
   "text": "It hits you like a physical shock."
  },
  {
   "start": 208.03,
   "end": 210.95,
   "text": "Hearing an ugly truth feels ten times more"
  },
  {
   "start": 210.95,
   "end": 212.87,
   "text": "loving than hearing a beautiful lie."
  },
  {
   "start": 213.33,
   "end": 215.71,
   "text": "Because for the first time in your life,"
  },
  {
   "start": 215.97,
   "end": 218.71,
   "text": "you are meeting a human being without armor."
  },
  {
   "start": 219.41,
   "end": 221.17,
   "text": "On the evening of day six,"
  },
  {
   "start": 221.55,
   "end": 224.17,
   "text": "you walk back to your apartment in complete silence."
  },
  {
   "start": 224.51,
   "end": 226.27,
   "text": "You realize that you have spent"
  },
  {
   "start": 226.27,
   "end": 228.33,
   "text": "five days judging the world."
  },
  {
   "start": 228.77,
   "end": 230.09,
   "text": "You analyzed your boss."
  },
  {
   "start": 230.51,
   "end": 231.63,
   "text": "You tested your friends."
  },
  {
   "start": 232.17,
   "end": 234.41,
   "text": "You graded every stranger on the subway."
  },
  {
   "start": 235.25,
   "end": 237.07,
   "text": "So you walk into your bathroom."
  },
  {
   "start": 237.75,
   "end": 238.53,
   "text": "You lock the door."
  },
  {
   "start": 238.53,
   "end": 241.19,
   "text": "And you look straight into your own reflection."
  },
  {
   "start": 242.19,
   "end": 244.27,
   "text": "I am happy with where I am in life,"
  },
  {
   "start": 244.61,
   "end": 245.03,
   "text": "you whisper."
  },
  {
   "start": 245.85,
   "end": 247.51,
   "text": "Crimson flash: Lie."
  },
  {
   "start": 247.51,
   "end": 250.07,
   "text": "I do not care what people think of me."
  },
  {
   "start": 250.69,
   "end": 252.25,
   "text": "Crimson flash: Lie."
  },
  {
   "start": 253.19,
   "end": 255.43,
   "text": "I have forgiven everyone who hurt me."
  },
  {
   "start": 255.87,
   "end": 257.17,
   "text": "A violent red pulse:"
  },
  {
   "start": 258.03,
   "end": 258.21,
   "text": "Lie."
  },
  {
   "start": 259.17,
   "end": 260.63,
   "text": "The tears start running down your cheeks."
  },
  {
   "start": 261.75,
   "end": 263.51,
   "text": "The most dangerous deceiver in your life"
  },
  {
   "start": 263.51,
   "end": 265.61,
   "text": "was never your coworker or your partner."
  },
  {
   "start": 266.01,
   "end": 266.77,
   "text": "It was you."
  },
  {
   "start": 267.45,
   "end": 270.09,
   "text": "We tell ourselves comfortable fairy tales so"
  },
  {
   "start": 270.09,
   "end": 272.07,
   "text": "we do not have to face our fear of failure,"
  },
  {
   "start": 272.11,
   "end": 273.59,
   "text": "our grief, and our loneliness."
  },
  {
   "start": 274.29,
   "end": 276.73,
   "text": "You stare into the mirror and finally say the"
  },
  {
   "start": 276.73,
   "end": 279.19,
   "text": "one thing you have avoided for ten years:"
  },
  {
   "start": 279.49,
   "end": 281.73,
   "text": "I am terrified of being alone."
  },
  {
   "start": 282.33,
   "end": 283.75,
   "text": "And I am trying my best."
  },
  {
   "start": 284.67,
   "end": 285.95,
   "text": "For the first time all week,"
  },
  {
   "start": 286.19,
   "end": 287.35,
   "text": "the crimson vanishes."
  },
  {
   "start": 288.05,
   "end": 291.13,
   "text": "A deep, tranquil green envelops the glass:"
  },
  {
   "start": 291.97,
   "end": 292.23,
   "text": "Truth."
  },
  {
   "start": 292.97,
   "end": 293.53,
   "text": "Absolute."
  },
  {
   "start": 293.99,
   "end": 296.45,
   "text": "Midnight arrives on the seventh day."
  },
  {
   "start": 296.45,
   "end": 299.99,
   "text": "The glowing tags fade into the quiet night air."
  },
  {
   "start": 300.69,
   "end": 302.09,
   "text": "Over the last six weeks,"
  },
  {
   "start": 302.29,
   "end": 305.15,
   "text": "you have experienced every impossible power:"
  },
  {
   "start": 305.81,
   "end": 307.65,
   "text": "You saw the salaries of every neighbor"
  },
  {
   "start": 307.65,
   "end": 310.07,
   "text": "and realized wealth buys comfort,"
  },
  {
   "start": 310.35,
   "end": 310.89,
   "text": "not peace."
  },
  {
   "start": 311.41,
   "end": 313.69,
   "text": "You saw the karma scores and learned"
  },
  {
   "start": 313.69,
   "end": 315.95,
   "text": "that morality is an inward discipline,"
  },
  {
   "start": 316.15,
   "end": 317.23,
   "text": "not a public spectacle."
  },
  {
   "start": 317.81,
   "end": 320.27,
   "text": "You heard what people whispered behind your back"
  },
  {
   "start": 320.27,
   "end": 323.55,
   "text": "and found the freedom of not needing applause."
  },
  {
   "start": 323.55,
   "end": 326.25,
   "text": "You tasted infinite save points and"
  },
  {
   "start": 326.25,
   "end": 328.07,
   "text": "discovered that life's beauty exists"
  },
  {
   "start": 328.07,
   "end": 330.39,
   "text": "only because mistakes are permanent."
  },
  {
   "start": 331.21,
   "end": 333.45,
   "text": "You saw the countdown clocks of mortality"
  },
  {
   "start": 333.45,
   "end": 335.99,
   "text": "and learned that our limited time is"
  },
  {
   "start": 335.99,
   "end": 337.91,
   "text": "what makes every moment sacred."
  },
  {
   "start": 338.79,
   "end": 341.19,
   "text": "And now, seeing every lie has"
  },
  {
   "start": 341.19,
   "end": 342.69,
   "text": "taught you the ultimate lesson:"
  },
  {
   "start": 343.47,
   "end": 345.77,
   "text": "Truth without empathy is cruelty."
  },
  {
   "start": 345.77,
   "end": 348.11,
   "text": "And honesty without vulnerability"
  },
  {
   "start": 348.11,
   "end": 349.61,
   "text": "is just another weapon."
  },
  {
   "start": 350.41,
   "end": 352.49,
   "text": "You step outside onto the morning sidewalk."
  },
  {
   "start": 352.95,
   "end": 355.23,
   "text": "The barista hands you your cup and says,"
  },
  {
   "start": 355.25,
   "end": 356.37,
   "text": "have a wonderful day."
  },
  {
   "start": 357.11,
   "end": 358.35,
   "text": "There is no green tag."
  },
  {
   "start": 358.79,
   "end": 359.85,
   "text": "There is no red tag."
  },
  {
   "start": 360.29,
   "end": 362.71,
   "text": "Just two strangers on a spinning rock,"
  },
  {
   "start": 362.71,
   "end": 364.65,
   "text": "trying to be kind to each other."
  },
  {
   "start": 365.51,
   "end": 366.81,
   "text": "You smile back at her,"
  },
  {
   "start": 367.11,
   "end": 368.27,
   "text": "take a sip of hot coffee,"
  },
  {
   "start": 368.69,
   "end": 370.51,
   "text": "and whisper: Thank you."
  },
  {
   "start": 370.51,
   "end": 371.95,
   "text": "And this time,"
  },
  {
   "start": 372.47,
   "end": 373.09,
   "text": "in your heart,"
  },
  {
   "start": 373.55,
   "end": 375.67,
   "text": "you know it is the absolute truth."
  }
 ],
